S  *            @arg RCC_SAIBCLKSOURCE_PLLR: PLL_R clock divided (R1) used as SAI1 Block A clock.
S  *            @arg RCC_SAIBCLKSOURCE_PLLSRC: HSI or HSE depending from PLL source Clock.
