N  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_CHANNEL_17
N  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_CHANNEL_18
N  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_CHANNEL_VREFINT      (1)
N  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TEMPSENSOR   (1)(2)
N  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_CHANNEL_VBAT         (1)
N  *
N  *         (1) On STM32F4, parameter available only on ADC instance: ADC1.\n
N  *         (2) On devices STM32F42x and STM32F43x, limitation: this internal channel is shared between temperature sensor and Vbat, only 1 measurement path must be enabled.\n
N  *         (1) For ADC channel read back from ADC register,
N  *             comparison with internal channel parameter to be done
N  *             using helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_CHANNEL_INTERNAL_TO_EXTERNAL().
